Feature: Clear completed button

  Background:
    Given I Visit "/"
    And I Add "buy some cheese"
    And I Add "feed the cat"
    And I Add "book a doctors appointment"

  @fixme
  Scenario: It shows once something is done
    When I Tick the Todo "buy some cheese"
    Then I should See the Button "Clear completed"

  @fixme
  Scenario: It removes what's done
    When I Tick the Todo "feed the cat"
    And I Click the Button "Clear completed"
    Then I should Not See "feed the cat"
    But I should See "buy some cheese"
    And I should See "book a doctors appointment"

  @fixme
  Scenario: It hides when nothing is done
    When I Tick the Todo "buy some cheese"
    And I Click the Button "Clear completed"
    Then I should Not See the Button "Clear completed"
